        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/r/c57346/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-03-01T21:37:03.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Quick questions for cards like resilient hide and 'exactly 1 damage':</p><p><span>a) Does reduced damage take into consideration when taking 'exactly 1 damage'? &nbsp;(I.E. I get hit for 2 damage and have damage reduced by 1 to take 1 net damage, would that then be prevented?)</span></p><p><span>b) Does exactly 1 mean i an attack does 1 fire and 1 melee, would it all be prevented or none of it?</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span>Thanks!</span></p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:40:38.042Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
