        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/k/58f4c7/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-03-02T00:38:12.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Me and my friend Max played against Voss using Knyfe, Haka, Naturalist, and Parse. I though that what the Above posters said was true, so due to Resiliant Hide and Rhino Form Naturalst survived more damage than he should have. It was pretty epic thanks to being able to Shapeshift out of turn due to the incaped guys.</p>",
