      {
        "id": 94314,
        "name": "Edwin",
        "username": "Edwin",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/73ab20/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-03-02T05:56:38.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Ameena\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/48/1907_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Ameena:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>And a one-shot, Threatening Stomp, which deals one target four damage and, if you're in Rhino Form, forcibly redirects all damage from that target onto you for a round. Tank power! <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Just make sure that you <em>stay in Rhino form</em> for the rest of that turn.&nbsp; I foolishly advised my Naturalist-playing buddy to switch to Gazelle so he could get extra healing from Phosphorescent Chamber, and then he ended up getting killed by a Sonic Mine hitting him four times instead of all four of us.&nbsp; Luckily, the player didn't hold a grudge; his other hero ended up being the last man standing while both of mine died, so Karma was satisfied.&nbsp; <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=12\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>",
        "post_number": 5,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:20:48.435Z",
